w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2400x1350+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fde%2F1b23fc234fee8492f166c21a7c55%2F6-images-3.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2400x1350+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fde%2F1b23fc234fee8492f166c21a7c55%2F6-images-3.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2400x1350+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd9%2Fde%2F1b23fc234fee8492f166c21a7c55%2F6-images-3.jpg" class="img" alt="Clockwise from left: The Social Reckoning, The Scout, Club Kid, Possible Love and Wildwood." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Clockwise from left: &lt;em&gt;The Social Reckoning, The Scout, Club Kid, Possible Love&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Wildwood.&lt;/em&gt;                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          &lt;i&gt;Columbia Pictures; Greenwich Entertainment; A24; Jaclyn Martinez/Amazon MGM Studios; Netflix; Laika&lt;/i&gt;                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check out what &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/sections/culture/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NPR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is watching, reading and listening to this weekend:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍿 Movies: &lt;/strong&gt;This fall, NPR critics are looking forward to a variety of films, including a follow-up to &lt;em&gt;The Social Network&lt;/em&gt;, the origin story of the &lt;em&gt;Rocky&lt;/em&gt; film and &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/11/nx-s1-5902182/what-to-watch-new-moviews-theaters" target="_blank"&gt;more than 20 other exciting movies&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📺 TV: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/17/nx-s1-5971146/last-seen-is-a-new-spin-on-troubled-detectives" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Last Seen&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; follows an emergency dispatcher as he becomes obsessed with uncovering the truth after receiving a call one night from a girl he believes might be his long-missing daughter.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📚 Books:&lt;/strong&gt; Kate Atkinson's &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/16/nx-s1-5969746/our-noble-selves-review-kate-atkinson" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our Noble Selves&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is a historical escape that focuses on the Festival of Britain, a real-life celebration aimed at uplifting British people's spirits after World War II.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎵 Music:&lt;/strong&gt; Neil Young's 50th studio album, &lt;em&gt;Second Song&lt;/em&gt;, features five new personal tracks along with two newly recorded songs that he wrote during his teenage years in Canada. Before the album's release today, &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/17/nx-s1-5887549/neil-young-new-album-second-song" target="_blank"&gt;Young spoke with NPR&lt;/a&gt; about this reflective work.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎭 Theater:&lt;/strong&gt; Theatre producer Francesca Moody, who was instrumental in bringing &lt;em&gt;Fleabag&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Baby Reindeer &lt;/em&gt;to the Edinburgh Fringe festival before their global success, told NPR &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/14/nx-s1-5968566/francesca-moody-fleabag-producer-hits-edinburgh" target="_blank"&gt;what she looks for in a performance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;❓ Quiz: &lt;/strong&gt;We've made it through another Friday without an AI apocalypse, &lt;em&gt;*phew*&lt;/em&gt;, so let's celebrate with a &lt;a href="http://npr.org/2026/09/18/g-s1-143768/celine-dion-trump-kennedy-center-emmys-news-quiz" target="_blank"&gt;quiz of this week's highlights&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-143820" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 4465;         --source-height: 2512;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4465x2512+0+233/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F60%2F48%2Faa2bf1d3423199aafddd4d94987e%2F09112026-mpr-superior10034.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4465x2512+0+233/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F60%2F48%2Faa2bf1d3423199aafddd4d94987e%2F09112026-mpr-superior10034.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4465x2512+0+233/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F60%2F48%2Faa2bf1d3423199aafddd4d94987e%2F09112026-mpr-superior10034.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4465x2512+0+233/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F60%2F48%2Faa2bf1d3423199aafddd4d94987e%2F09112026-mpr-superior10034.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/di