0w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2401x1351+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F9a%2F89%2Fc4fad5ce4f94980f9c17b00b9dd5%2F260903-watts-nprhealthcareaz-24bw-cropped.jpg" class="img" alt="Dr. William Richardson opens the telemedicine portal at his clinic, Choices Women’s Center, through which he can see patients seeking an abortion, in his office at the clinic in Tucson, Ariz., on Thursday, Sept. 3, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Dr. William Richardson opens the telemedicine portal at his clinic, Choices Women's Center, through which he can see patients seeking an abortion, in his office at the clinic in Tucson, Ariz., on Thursday, Sept. 3, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Anna Watts for NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The Food and Drug Administration allowed health care providers to prescribe the abortion pill mifepristone via telehealth and send it by mail beginning during the COVID-19 pandemic. In 2023, the agency made the change permanent. Now, the Fifth Circuit Court of Appeals in New Orleans is hearing oral arguments in &lt;em&gt;Louisiana v. FDA&lt;/em&gt;, a case that could end nationwide access to telehealth for Mifepristone. Here's &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/08/nx-s1-5955665/telehealth-abortion-pill-mifepristone-louisiana" target="_blank"&gt;what we know about the legal challenge&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;ul class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;💊 Louisiana argues that mail-order access makes it harder to enforce its abortion ban because patients can consult providers in states with shield laws and receive medication by mail.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💊 The state is challenging the FDA's decision to remove the in-person dispensing requirement, citing states' rights and patient safety concerns.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;💊The Supreme Court intervened earlier this year to keep the FDA's current rules in place while the case proceeds. The legal fight could return to the court.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;Picture show&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-142198" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 2050;         --source-height: 1154;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/2050x1154+882+1770/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fd7%2F50%2F5a1c89c54c488843f09812a09fe3%2Fweather-keeper-interior-v9-5.jpg" class="img" alt="Weather Keeper_Interior_v9_5.jpg" loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;Nelly Buchet's new picture book,&lt;em&gt; The Weather Keeper&lt;/em&gt;, was inspired by a woman who runs one of Iceland's 71 manned weather stations. The story follows a daughter as she decides whether to return to her small town or forge a new path in the city, with illustrator Elizabeth Haidle capturing the rhythms of a weather keeper's daily life. See &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/13/nx-s1-5902250/the-weather-keeper-nelly-buchet-elizabeth-haidle" target="_blank"&gt;photos from the book&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-143103" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 3231;         --source-height: 1817;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/3231x1817+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb3%2Fd1%2F12cb5e554d49be949447d540b0d6%2Fap26255714607289.jpg" class="img" alt="Singer Celine Dion performs during the opening concert of her &amp;#039;Celine Dion Paris 2026&amp;#039; residency at the Plenitude Arena in Nanterre, outside Paris, Saturday, Sept. 12, 2026." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Singer Celine Dion performs during the opening concert of her 'Celine Dion Paris 2026' residency at the Plenitude Arena in Nanterre, outside Paris, Saturday, Sept. 12, 2026.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Aurelien Morissard/AP                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;ol class="edTag"&gt;&lt;li&gt;Celine Dion &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/12/nx-s1-5967534/celine-dion-performance-paris" target="_blank"&gt;returned to the stage&lt;/a&gt; this weekend, launching her 16-show residency in Paris nearly four years after revealing she had been diagnosed with a rare, painful condition.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;U.S. Rep. Tom Tiffany, the Republican candidate for Wisconsin governor, said that he and a pilot &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/13/nx-s1-5968081/wisconsin-congressman-survives-emergency-plane-landing-swims-to-safety" target="_blank"&gt;had to swim to safety&lt;/a&gt; after their small single-engine plane made an emergency landing in a lake on Saturday.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;A Pennsylvania official has &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/09/13/nx-s1-5968093/pennsylvania-says-an-unvaccinated-woman-has-died-from-measles-related-complications" target="_blank"&gt;confirmed the measles-related death&lt;/a&gt; of a 40-year-old unvaccinated woman, the third death linked to measles in the state this year.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;       &lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This newsletter was edited by &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/people/1155154221/majd-al-waheidi"target="_blank"   &gt;&lt;em&gt;Majd Al-Waheidi&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
