4077.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x2531+0+234/resize/1800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2F53%2F3a12f9554231baf4c836fa2eddd2%2Frwanda-bridge-4077.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x2531+0+234/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2F53%2F3a12f9554231baf4c836fa2eddd2%2Frwanda-bridge-4077.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/jpeg" /&gt;             &lt;img src="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x2531+0+234/resize/1100/quality/50/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2F53%2F3a12f9554231baf4c836fa2eddd2%2Frwanda-bridge-4077.jpg" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/4500x2531+0+234/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F66%2F53%2F3a12f9554231baf4c836fa2eddd2%2Frwanda-bridge-4077.jpg" class="img" alt="Naomi Nibishaka crosses the bridge." loading="lazy" /&gt;         &lt;/picture&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;div class="credit-caption"&gt;     &lt;div class="caption-wrap"&gt;         &lt;div class="caption" aria-label="Image caption"&gt;             &lt;p&gt;                 Naomi Nibishaka crosses the bridge.                 &lt;b class="credit" aria-label="Image credit"&gt;                                          Claire Harbage/NPR                                      &lt;/b&gt;                 &lt;b class="hide-caption"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/p&gt;         &lt;/div&gt;               &lt;b class="toggle-caption"&gt;               &lt;svg class="icon icon--info"&gt;&lt;use href="#icon-info"&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;               &lt;b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;             &lt;/b&gt;     &lt;/div&gt;       &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;/div&gt;    &lt;p&gt;The bridge-building nonprofit Fika is connecting communities in Rwanda separated by rivers and gorges. Since 2020, the charity has built 96 bridges, and a new study shows that life in those areas looks very different now. People are able to access assets that were once hard to reach. Before the bridges, crossing options could be costly and dangerous. But now, people have better access to healthcare, schools and even post offices that were previously only on the other side of the crossing. See &lt;a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/08/29/nx-s1-5927173/bridges-remote-communities-rwanda" target="_blank"&gt;photos of some of the towns changed&lt;/a&gt; by these bridges and read more about their impact.&lt;/p&gt;       &lt;h3 class="edTag"&gt;3 things to know before you go&lt;/h3&gt;   &lt;div id="resg-s1-141822" class="bucketwrap image large"&gt;             &lt;div     class="imagewrap has-source-dimensions"     data-crop-type=""     style="         --source-width: 1600;         --source-height: 900;     " &gt;         &lt;picture&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 1200w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/1600/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 1600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/1800/quality/85/format/webp/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 1800w" data-template="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/{width}/quality/{quality}/format/{format}/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg" sizes="(min-width: 1025px) 650px, calc(100vw - 30px)" class="img" type="image/webp" /&gt;             &lt;source srcset="https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/400/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 400w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/600/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 600w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/800/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 800w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/900/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c641f981b2346c526efb82%2Fzain.jpg 900w, https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims3/default/strip/false/crop/1600x900+0+0/resize/1200/quality/85/format/jpeg/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F85%2F2b%2Fcc0a68c64